notes               = "Untitled in source. The poet was born in ۱۳۱۸/1939, so 'fifty years' is his own life and the turtledove on the snow-laden branch is a self-portrait; page 159's 'fifty-five springs' gives the same birth year. 19 Dey = 9 January 1991. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
